#: src/doc.cls.php:69
msgid "This site utilizes caching in order to facilitate a faster response time and better user experience. Caching potentially stores a duplicate copy of every web page that is on display on this site. All cache files are temporary, and are never accessed by any third party, except as necessary to obtain technical support from the cache plugin vendor. Cache files expire on a schedule set by the site administrator, but may easily be purged by the admin before their natural expiration, if necessary. We may use QUIC.cloud services to process & cache your data temporarily."
msgstr "Boggan wuxuu adeegsadaa keydka ku meel-gaarka ah (caching) si loo fududeeyo jawaab degdeg ah iyo waayo-aragnimo isticmaale oo wanaagsan. Keydka ku meel-gaarka ah wuxuu suurtogal ka dhigayaa inuu kaydiyo koobbi labaad oo bog kasta oo shabakad ah oo ka muuqda boggan. Dhammaan faylasha keydka waa kuwo ku meel-gaar ah, mana heli karo cid saddexaad, marka laga reebo sida lagama maarmaanka u ah helitaanka taageerada farsamo ee iibiyaha furaha keydka (cache plugin). Faylasha keydka waxay dhacaan jadwalka uu dejiyay maamulaha bogga, laakiin waxaa si fudud u tirtiri kara maamulaha ka hor intaanay dhicin waqtigooda dabiiciga ah, haddii loo baahdo. Waxaan isticmaali karnaa adeegyada QUIC.cloud si aan u baahino oo u keydino xogtaada si ku meel gaar ah."

